---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../../../components/Section.astro';
import CtaBanner from '../../../components/CtaBanner.astro';
import FaqItem from '../../../components/FaqItem.astro';
import ArrowLink from '../../../components/ArrowLink.astro';
import Placeholder from '../../../components/Placeholder.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Engineering Plans for Homes Adelaide | UEC"
  description="Engineering plans for Adelaide homes and extensions: footings, structure, site works and drainage, prepared for Building Consent."
>
  <PageHero
    title="Engineering plans that keep your home solid and compliant"
    image="/images/p1.jpg"
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Services', href: '/services/' }, { label: 'Plans', href: '/services/plans/' }]}
    crumb="Engineering Plans"
    tabs="plans"
  >
    <p class="lead">Engineering plans show how your home will stand up and how water will be managed around it. They’re needed for Building Consent and they guide your builder on site.</p>
    <ArrowLink class="btn btn-white btn-lg" href="/contact/" slot="actions">Request a quote for plans</ArrowLink>
  </PageHero>

  <Section num="01" title="What’s included">
    <p><Placeholder>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: standard inclusions.]</Placeholder></p>
    <ul class="dlist">
      <li>Footing and slab plans</li>
      <li>Structural framing and beam details</li>
      <li>Site works and levels</li>
      <li>Stormwater and drainage layout</li>
      <li>Retaining wall details where needed</li>
      <li>Engineering notes and specifications</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <Section num="02" title="Engineering plans vs structural plans" alt>
    <p>Our engineering plans cover the full engineering package for your project, including site works and drainage. Our structural plans focus on the structure itself: footings, frames and beams. Many projects need both, and we can prepare them together.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <ArrowLink class="tlink" href="/services/plans/structural-plan/">Structural plan</ArrowLink>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section num="03" title="Prepared for Adelaide conditions">
    <p>With reactive clay soils common in many parts of Adelaide, your engineering needs to suit your site. Our plans are based on your soil report and site classification.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <ArrowLink class="tlink" href="/services/structural-engineering/footings-foundations/">Footings and foundations</ArrowLink>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section num="04" title="For builders and owner-builders" alt>
    <p>Need engineering plans for a project you’re building yourself? We work with builders and owner-builders across Adelaide.</p>
  </Section>

  <Section num="05" title="Frequently asked questions">
    <div class="faq">
      <FaqItem question="Do I need engineering plans for an extension?">
        <p>Most extensions need engineering for footings and structure. We’ll tell you what your project needs.</p>
      </FaqItem>
      <FaqItem question="Will you certify the engineering?">
        <p><Placeholder>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM: certification provided and by whom.]</Placeholder></p>
      </FaqItem>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <CtaBanner title="Get your engineering plans">
    <ArrowLink class="btn btn-sand btn-lg" href="/contact/">Request a quote for plans</ArrowLink>
  </CtaBanner>
</BaseLayout>
